VALUES
  ('in the midst of', 'in the midst of', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in the midst of","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"在...之中","example":{"en":"Dorothy lived in the midst of the great Kansas prairies, with Uncle Henry, who was a farmer, and Aunt Em, who was the farmer’s wife.","cn":"多萝西和亨利叔叔、艾姆婶婶住在一起。亨利叔叔是农民，艾姆婶婶是农民的妻子。他们住在大大的堪萨斯草原中间。"},"note":"表示在（某物或某事）中间或当中。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[1]}'::jsonb),
  ('at all', 'at all', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"at all","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"根本不，一点也不","example":{"en":"There was no garret at all, and no cellar—except a small hole dug in the ground, called a cyclone cellar, where the family could go in case one of those great whirlwinds arose, mighty enough to crush any building in its path.","cn":"家里没有阁楼，也没有地窖。只有一个小小的洞，挖在地上，大家叫它‘龙卷风地窖’。要是来了大大的龙卷风，能把房子都刮倒，他们就躲到里面去。"},"note":"用于否定句或疑问句，起强调作用。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[5]}'::jsonb),
  ('in case', 'in case', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in case","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"万一，以防","example":{"en":"There was no garret at all, and no cellar—except a small hole dug in the ground, called a cyclone cellar, where the family could go in case one of those great whirlwinds arose, mighty enough to crush any building in its path.","cn":"家里没有阁楼，也没有地窖。只有一个小小的洞，挖在地上，大家叫它‘龙卷风地窖’。要是来了大大的龙卷风，能把房子都刮倒，他们就躲到里面去。"},"note":"引导一个从句，表示可能发生的情况。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[5]}'::jsonb),
  ('in the middle of', 'in the middle of', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in the middle of","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"在...中间","example":{"en":"It was reached by a trap door in the middle of the floor, from which a ladder led down into the small, dark hole.","cn":"从地板中间的一个暗门进去，有一架梯子通到那个又小又黑的洞里。"},"note":"表示在某物体的中心位置。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[6]}'::jsonb),
  ('looked around', 'looked around', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"looked around","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"环顾四周","example":{"en":"When Dorothy stood in the doorway and looked around, she could see nothing but the great gray prairie on every side.","cn":"当多萝西站在门边向四周看时，她只能看到一片大大的灰色草原，什么都没有。"},"note":"表示向周围的各个方向看。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[7]}'::jsonb),
  ('nothing but', 'nothing but', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"nothing but","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"只有，除了...什么也没有","example":{"en":"When Dorothy stood in the doorway and looked around, she could see nothing but the great gray prairie on every side.","cn":"当多萝西站在门边向四周看时，她只能看到一片大大的灰色草原，什么都没有。"},"note":"强调唯一性。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[7]}'::jsonb),
  ('in all directions', 'in all directions', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in all directions","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"四面八方，各个方向","example":{"en":"Not a tree nor a house broke the broad sweep of flat country that reached to the edge of the sky in all directions.","cn":"没有一棵树，也没有一座房子，只有平坦的土地一直延伸到天边。"},"note":"指指向所有方向。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[8]}'::jsonb),
  ('washed it away', 'washed it away', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"washed it away","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"冲走了它","example":{"en":"Once the house had been painted, but the sun blistered the paint and the rains washed it away, and now the house was as dull and gray as everything else.","cn":"房子以前漆过油漆，但是太阳把油漆晒得起了泡，雨水又把油漆冲掉了。现在房子也变得和周围的一切一样，又暗又灰。"},"note":"表示用水流把某物冲走。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[11]}'::jsonb),
  ('laugh at', 'laugh at', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"laugh at","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"嘲笑，取笑","example":{"en":"When Dorothy, who was an orphan, first came to her, Aunt Em had been so startled by the child’s laughter that she would scream and press her hand upon her heart whenever Dorothy’s merry voice reached her ears; and she still looked at the little girl with wonder that she could find anything to laugh at.","cn":"当多萝西（她是一个孤儿）刚来到她身边时，艾姆婶婶听到孩子笑声时吓了一跳，每次多萝西开心笑出声，她都会尖叫，捂住自己的心口。她还是会好奇地看着这个小女孩，想不通她有什么好笑的。"},"note":"表示因某事或某人感到好笑或嘲弄。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[16]}'::jsonb),
  ('from morning till night', 'from morning till night', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"from morning till night","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"从早到晚","example":{"en":"He worked hard from morning till night and did not know what joy was.","cn":"他从早到晚努力干活，不知道什么叫快乐。"},"note":"表示一整天的时间。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[18]}'::jsonb),
