  ('in the air', 'in the air', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in the air","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"在空中","example":{"en":"There now came a sharp whistling in the air from the south, and as they turned their eyes that way they saw ripples in the grass coming from that direction also.","cn":"现在，南方传来一阵尖锐的呼啸声，他们朝那个方向看去，看到草地上也出现了波浪，从那边涌过来。"},"note":"指在空气中。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[28]}'::jsonb),
