  ('lost her footing', 'lost her footing', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"lost her footing","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"站不稳，失足","example":{"en":"When she was halfway across the room there came a great shriek from the wind, and the house shook so hard that she lost her footing and sat down suddenly upon the floor.","cn":"当她走到房间一半的时候，风发出了一声巨大的尖叫，房子摇晃得太厉害，她站不稳，一下子就坐在了地上。"},"note":"表示失去平衡。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[39]}'::jsonb),
