  ('as it was', 'as it was', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"as it was","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"尽管如此，事实是","example":{"en":"As it was, the jar made her catch her breath and wonder what had happened; and Toto put his cold little nose into her face and whined dismally.","cn":"尽管如此，这一震还是让她倒吸一口气，想知道发生了什么；托托把冰冷的小鼻子伸到她脸上，可怜地呜咽着。"},"note":"用于引出与预期或普遍看法相反的事实。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[57]}'::jsonb),
  ('in fact', 'in fact', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in fact","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"事实上","example":{"en":"In fact, they seemed about as tall as Dorothy, who was a well-grown child for her age, although they were, so far as looks go, many years older.","cn":"他们看起来跟多萝西差不多高，多萝西在同龄孩子里算长得挺好的。不过，他们看起来比多萝西大很多岁。"},"note":"用于强调或修正之前的陈述。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[67]}'::jsonb),
  ('mean by', 'mean by', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"mean by","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"意指，意思是","example":{"en":"What could the little woman possibly mean by calling her a sorceress, and saying she had killed the Wicked Witch of the East?","cn":"这个小妇人叫她魔法师，还说她杀了那个东方坏女巫，到底是什么意思呢？"},"note":"指某句话或行为的含义。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[81]}'::jsonb),
  ('there must be some mistake', 'there must be some mistake', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"there must be some mistake","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"一定有误会","example":{"en":"But the little woman evidently expected her to answer; so Dorothy said, with hesitation, “You are very kind, but there must be some mistake.","cn":"但那个小妇人显然在等她回答，所以多萝西有些迟疑地说：“你人很好，但这一定弄错了。"},"note":"用于表达认为有错误或误解。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[83]}'::jsonb),
  ('in dismay', 'in dismay', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"in dismay","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"沮丧地","example":{"en":"Oh, dear!” cried Dorothy, clasping her hands together in dismay.","cn":"哎呀！”多萝西沮丧地把手合在一起，叫道。"},"note":"指带着失望和沮丧。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[90]}'::jsonb),
  ('nothing to be done', 'nothing to be done', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"nothing to be done","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"无能为力，没什么可做的","example":{"en":"“There is nothing to be done,” said the little woman calmly.","cn":"“没办法了，”小个子女人平静地说。"},"note":"指没有办法或无需采取行动。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[93]}'::jsonb),
  ('at once', 'at once', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"at once","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"立刻","example":{"en":"When they saw the Witch of the East was dead the Munchkins sent a swift messenger to me, and I came at once.","cn":"他们看到东方女巫死了，芒奇金人就马上派人告诉我，我一下子就来了。"},"note":"指立即，马上。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[102]}'::jsonb),
