  ('turning his head', 'turning his head', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"turning his head","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"转过头","example":{"en":"The Tin Woodman was about to reply when he heard a low growl, and turning his head (which worked beautifully on hinges) he saw a strange beast come bounding over the grass toward them.","cn":"铁皮人正要回答，突然听到一声低沉的吼叫。他转过头（他的头在铰链上转得很漂亮），看到一只奇怪的野兽从草地上向他们跑来。"},"note":"强搭配 ''turn one''s head'' 意为“转头看”。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[743]}'::jsonb),
