  ('it happens to be', 'it happens to be', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"it happens to be","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"碰巧是","example":{"en":"“I have no heart, you know, so I am careful to help all those who may need a friend, even if it happens to be only a mouse.”","cn":"“我没有心，所以我会很小心地帮助那些需要朋友的人，就算它只是一只小老鼠。”"},"note":"固定表达 ''happen to be'' 意为“碰巧是，恰好是”。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[751]}'::jsonb),
