  ('known very well', 'known very well', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"known very well","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"很清楚","example":{"en":"One by one the mice came creeping back, and Toto did not bark again, although he tried to get out of the Woodman’s arms, and would have bitten him had he not known very well he was made of tin.","cn":"老鼠们一只接一只地爬了回来。托托没有再叫，虽然他努力想从铁皮人的怀里挣脱出去，如果他不知道铁皮人是铁皮做的，他肯定会咬他一口。"},"note":"强搭配 ''know very well'' 意为“很清楚，非常了解”。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[769]}'::jsonb),
  ('nothing that i know of', 'nothing that i know of', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"nothing that i know of","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"据我所知，没有","example":{"en":"“Nothing that I know of,” answered the Woodman; but the Scarecrow, who had been trying to think, but could not because his head was stuffed with straw, said, quickly, “Oh, yes; you can save our friend, the Cowardly Lion, who is asleep in the poppy bed.”","cn":"“据我所知，没有什么。”铁皮人回答道。但是稻草人，他一直在努力思考，却想不出来，因为他的脑袋里塞满了稻草，他很快地说：“哦，有了！你们可以救我们的朋友胆小的狮子，他睡在罂粟花丛里呢。”"},"note":"固定表达 ''nothing that I know of'' 意为“据我所知，没有（什么）”。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[772]}'::jsonb),
  ('some time before', 'some time before', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"some time before","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"在...之前过了一段时间","example":{"en":"It was some time before the Cowardly Lion awakened, for he had lain among the poppies a long while, breathing in their deadly fragrance; but when he did open his eyes and roll off the truck he was very glad to find himself still alive.","cn":"胆小的狮子睡了一会儿才醒来。他躺在罂粟花里很久，吸了它们危险的香味。当他睁开眼睛，从车上滚下来时，他很高兴自己还活着。"},"note":"表示某事发生之前等待了一段时间。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[811]}'::jsonb),
  ('breathing in', 'breathing in', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"breathing in","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"吸入","example":{"en":"It was some time before the Cowardly Lion awakened, for he had lain among the poppies a long while, breathing in their deadly fragrance; but when he did open his eyes and roll off the truck he was very glad to find himself still alive.","cn":"胆小的狮子睡了一会儿才醒来。他躺在罂粟花里很久，吸了它们危险的香味。当他睁开眼睛，从车上滚下来时，他很高兴自己还活着。"},"note":"表示吸进气体或气味。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[811]}'::jsonb),
