  ('as fast as i could', 'as fast as i could', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"as fast as i could","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"尽我所能地快","example":{"en":"“I ran as fast as I could,” he said, sitting down and yawning, “but the flowers were too strong for me.","cn":"他坐下来打着哈欠说：“我跑得很快，但这些花太厉害了。”"},"note":"表示以最快的速度。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[812]}'::jsonb),
  ('saved my life', 'saved my life', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"saved my life","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"救了我的命","example":{"en":"“I have always thought myself very big and terrible; yet such little things as flowers came near to killing me, and such small animals as mice have saved my life.","cn":"“我一直觉得自己又高又壮，很厉害。可是，像花这样小的东西差点要了我的命，而像老鼠这样小的动物却救了我的命。”"},"note":"表示使某人免于死亡。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[815]}'::jsonb),
  ('journey on', 'journey on', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"journey on","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"继续旅行","example":{"en":"“We must journey on until we find the road of yellow brick again,” said Dorothy, “and then we can keep on to the Emerald City.”","cn":"“我们必须一直往前走，直到再次找到黄砖路，”多萝西说，“然后我们就能去到翡翠城了。”"},"note":"表示继续前进或旅行。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[818]}'::jsonb),
  ('it was not long before', 'it was not long before', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"it was not long before","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"没过多久","example":{"en":"So, the Lion being fully refreshed, and feeling quite himself again, they all started upon the journey, greatly enjoying the walk through the soft, fresh grass; and it was not long before they reached the road of yellow brick and turned again toward the Emerald City where the Great Oz dwelt.","cn":"于是，狮子精神完全恢复了，感觉又像以前一样了。他们都开始旅行，很喜欢走在柔软新鲜的草地上。没多久，他们就走到了黄砖路，再次走向伟大的奥兹大王住的翡翠城。"},"note":"表示某事很快就发生了。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[819]}'::jsonb),
  ('far behind', 'far behind', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"far behind","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"远远地落在后面","example":{"en":"The road was smooth and well paved, now, and the country about was beautiful, so that the travelers rejoiced in leaving the forest far behind, and with it the many dangers they had met in its gloomy shades.","cn":"现在路面又平又好走，周围的景色也很美。旅行者们很高兴把森林远远地抛在身后，也把他们在黑暗森林里遇到的许多危险抛开了。"},"note":"表示距离某个事物很远。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[820]}'::jsonb),
  ('came to', 'came to', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"came to","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"来到, 到达","example":{"en":"Once more they could see fences built beside the road; but these were painted green, and when they came to a small house, in which a farmer evidently lived, that also was painted green.","cn":"他们再次看到路边有篱笆了，这些篱笆都被漆成了绿色。当他们走到一间小房子前，里面好像住着一个农夫，那房子也被漆成了绿色。"},"note":"表示抵达某个地方。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[821]}'::jsonb),
  ('because of', 'because of', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"because of","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"因为, 由于","example":{"en":"They passed by several of these houses during the afternoon, and sometimes people came to the doors and looked at them as if they would like to ask questions; but no one came near them nor spoke to them because of the great Lion, of which they were very much afraid.","cn":"整个下午，他们经过了好几间这样的房子。有时有人走到门口，看着他们，好像想问问题。但没人走近他们，也没人跟他们说话，因为他们很害怕那个大大的狮子。"},"note":"表示原因。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[822]}'::jsonb),
  ('thinking it over', 'thinking it over', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"thinking it over","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"仔细考虑","example":{"en":"“Well,” said the woman, after thinking it over and taking another peep at the Lion, “if that is the case you may come in, and I will give you some supper and a place to sleep.”","cn":"“好吧，”女人想了想，又偷偷看了看狮子，说，“如果真是这样，你们可以进来，我会给你们一些晚饭和睡觉的地方。”"},"note":"表示认真思考某事。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[836]}'::jsonb),
  ('if that is the case', 'if that is the case', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"if that is the case","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"如果是这样","example":{"en":"“Well,” said the woman, after thinking it over and taking another peep at the Lion, “if that is the case you may come in, and I will give you some supper and a place to sleep.”","cn":"“好吧，”女人想了想，又偷偷看了看狮子，说，“如果真是这样，你们可以进来，我会给你们一些晚饭和睡觉的地方。”"},"note":"表示在某种情况下。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[836]}'::jsonb),
