  ('laying the table', 'laying the table', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"laying the table","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"摆桌子, 摆餐具","example":{"en":"They seemed greatly surprised to see so strange a company, and while the woman was busy laying the table the man asked:","cn":"他们看到这么一群陌生人，显得非常惊讶。女人忙着摆桌子的时候，男人问道："},"note":"表示为用餐准备餐桌。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[839]}'::jsonb),
