  ('no longer', 'no longer', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"no longer","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"不再","example":{"en":"Dorothy still wore the pretty silk dress she had put on in the palace, but now, to her surprise, she found it was no longer green, but pure white.","cn":"多萝西还穿着在宫殿里的漂亮丝绸裙子，但让她惊讶的是，裙子不再是绿色，而是纯白色了。"},"note":"表示某事不再发生或不再是某种状态。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[1115]}'::jsonb),
