  ('prevent them from', 'prevent them from', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"prevent them from","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"阻止他们做某事","example":{"en":"But he had no arms at all, and, seeing this, the Scarecrow did not fear that so helpless a creature could prevent them from climbing the hill.","cn":"可是他一点胳膊都没有！看到这，稻草人觉得这个没有胳膊的人帮不了什么忙，所以不怕他阻止自己爬山。"},"note":"常用结构为 \"prevent someone/something from doing something\"。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[1983]}'::jsonb),
  ('whether you like it or not', 'whether you like it or not', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"whether you like it or not","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"不管你喜不喜欢；无论如何","example":{"en":"So he said, “I’m sorry not to do as you wish, but we must pass over your hill whether you like it or not,” and he walked boldly forward.","cn":"于是他说：“不好意思，我们不能听你的，不管你喜不喜欢，我们都得过这座山。”他大胆地往前走。"},"note":"表示无论对方意愿如何，某事都会发生。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[1984]}'::jsonb),
  ('as quick as lightning', 'as quick as lightning', 'en', 'read-v1', '{"word":"as quick as lightning","pos":"词块","ipa":"","gloss_cn":"像闪电一样快","example":{"en":"As quick as lightning the man’s head shot forward and his neck stretched out until the top of the head, where it was flat, struck the Scarecrow in the middle and sent him tumbling, over and over, down the hill.","cn":"像闪电一样快，那个人的头往前一冲，脖子伸得好长，他平平的头顶正好打在稻草人的身上，把稻草人撞得咕噜噜地滚下了山。"},"note":"形容速度非常快。","kind":"chunk","src_seqs":[1985]}'::jsonb),
